            "review_text": "kenl461\nBritish Columbia, Canada2135 contributions\n0\nSaigon Palace Restaurant\nApr 2018 • Couples\nOur group stayed at the Grand Hotel in Saigon & had a set dinner at the Saigon Palace Restaurant the 1st night & breakfast buffets for the days thereafter. The dinner was tasty & very good.\n\nThe breakfast buffet has a nice selection of both Asian & Western food.\n\nWe found the restaurant to be very clean, bright & roomy. The wait staff were friendly & courteous.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 19, 2018",
