            "review_text": "Nick D\nCalgary, Canada1188 contributions\n0\nlunch is incredible\nMar 2017 • Couples\nwe had the opportunity to eat a buffet lunch at the hotel. A great small orchestra played local music and dancers in national dress did traditional dances. Wonderful. The meal was splendid - I never had lotus stems before but would happily eat the marinated stems again - but watch out they are in with some very spice chilies. There was something for everyone - meats, seafood, vegetables, salads and even some fruits and sweets for dessert. Service was great. Really enjoyed my time there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 2, 2017",
