            "review_text": "jpl346\nOttawa, Canada66 contributions\n0\nTake out...\nMar 2017 • Couples\nStaying at the Majestic Hotel around the corner. One night after spending the day visiting the city we did not feel like going out and spend 2-3 hours in a restaurant, I went to Saigon Palace on the advice of the Hotel's concierge.\nGot 2 boxes of different kinds of sushi with chopsticks, ginger, wasabi and soya sauce. Excellent and fresh sushis at a very reasonable price. A good alternative to expensive hotel food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 3, 2017",
