            "review_text": "DANIEL L\nBunbury, Australia10541 contributions\n0\nGreat breakfast selection\nNov 2016 • Friends\nStaying at the Grand Hotel with out tour group and enjoyed great breakfasts during our 5 day stay. Extensive selection of European, Vietnamese and other Asian delicacies every morning - probably one of the most extensive buffets that I have seen in a hotel dining room. Egg station available to cook to your request. Gracious service, but can be a little wanting at times when the restaurant is busy. Most dishes replenished regularly but some remain empty at times. In fairness, it must be a difficult to anticipate the needs of diners when offering an extensive buffet menu. Food quality excellent.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 14, 2016",
